category: Science
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran
sdesc: "Packing optimization for molecular dynamics simulations"
ldesc: "Packmol creates an initial point for molecular dynamics simulations by packing
molecules in defined regions of space. The packing guarantees that short range
repulsive interactions do not disrupt the simulations."
